    },
    {
      "name": "test_single_prime_addition",
      "intent": "If all primes in the input are identical (prime p, count k), run the program on the original input and on the input with one extra copy of p (count k+1). Let out_orig and out_extra be the outputs. Assert that out_extra == (out_orig * pow(p, k+1, 1000000007)) % 1000000007. A violation is inequality."
    },
