      "name": "test_relabeling_invariance",
      "intent": "Apply a fixed permutation to the labels (e.g., map each label i to (i mod n) + 1) to both a and b to obtain new permutations. Run the program on the relabeled input and assert the output equals the original, as the problem depends only on equality of values, not their identities."
