}

{
  "rationale": "The tests ensure the answer is within logical bounds, invariant under symmetry and various transformations (simultaneous/individual rotations, value permutations, reversal), and satisfies necessary conditions derived from the input (achievable matches). They catch errors like off‑by‑one shifts, mishandled indexing, or counts outside possible ranges. The first to drop would be test_complement, as it is a special case of value permutation already covered by test_value_permutation_cyclic.",
  "plan": [
